## Slide 19

ProdSched Extensibility

The scheduling logic has built in troubleshooting and extensibility
When run, the scheduler will output information to the tPsStageMessage table. 
When Verbose Logging is enabled, additional messages will be recorded for each job that gets assigned.
Scheduling settings can be assigned, and scheduling can be completed through API calls. 
Additional script classes exist for extensible logic hooks as well.